# LLM-judge scoring prompt(s) (#585, epic #581; per-role judges #1630, epic #1627)
# — a skill-quality input on a par with the held-out cases: the rubric the
# candidate is graded against. Owner-lock the base judge AND every per-role judge
# (evals/<role>/judge.md) so the proposer can never weaken the rubric it must
# satisfy, nor loosen the threshold in scorer.json.
/evals/judge.md @petry-projects/org-leads
/evals/**/judge.md @petry-projects/org-leads
/evals/**/scorer.json @petry-projects/org-leads

